# Uber Property Investments — environment variables.
#
# This site currently needs NO environment variables:
# - The lead form uses Netlify Forms (no API key; see docs/lead-capture.md).
# - There is no database, no CMS and no third-party API.
#
# If a server-side integration is ever added (for example, an email API for
# a custom form endpoint), add its key here as a commented example first,
# document it in docs/architecture.md, and set the real value only in the
# Netlify dashboard (Site configuration -> Environment variables).
# Never commit a real .env file.
